# Always deploy when ready

When a feature, fix, or live-app change is complete:

1. Commit the relevant files (skip secrets, `.env`, `*.db`, token dumps).
2. Push to `origin main` immediately so Streamlit Community Cloud redeploys.
3. Do not wait for a separate “push” or “redeploy” message.

This repo deploys from GitHub `main`. A ready change is not finished until it is on `origin/main`.
